        "payload": {
          "content": "Beacon Works initial plan:\n- 09-11h high-load burst (6.3 kW total) → src_Hydro\n- 11-16h light load (1.5 kW) → src_Geothermal\n- src_Wind left free for others\n\nOur Hydro draw 09-11h: 6.3 kW; Hydro capacity those hours 5.1-5.2 kW, so we’ll count on ≤ ≈1 kW headroom from the other two clients. If you expect more, please flag so we can re-balance early.",
